  "description": "Have I Been Pwned \"Pwned Passwords\" k-anonymity client for Masterly.Hash: implements IBreachedPasswordChecker from Masterly.Hash.Policy. Sends only the first 5 hex characters of the password's SHA-1 hash, requests padded responses, fails open (or throws) on outages and timeouts, and offers a bounded in-memory range cache plus an AddPwnedPasswords() typed HttpClient registration.",
